xt": "Construction Liabilities", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [16.435546875, 505.44140625, 758.1328125, 535.1871643066406], "text": "We capitalize construction in progress and record a corresponding long-term liability for build-to-suit lease agreements where we are considered the owner during the construction period for accounting purposes. These liabilities primarily relate to our corporate buildings and fulfillment, sortation, delivery, and data centers.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [27.791015625, 547.98046875, 254.7755584716797, 557.4621887207031], "text": "Tax Contingencies", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [15.837890625, 561.515625, 786.1671142578125, 591.8871765136719], "text": "We have recorded reserves for tax contingencies, inclusive of accrued interest and penalties, for U.S. and foreign income taxes. These reserves primarily relate to transfer pricing, research and development credits, and state income taxes, and are presented net of offsetting deferred tax assets related to net operating losses and tax credits. See \"Note 10\u2014Income Taxes\" for discussion of tax contingencies.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [300.0234375, 602.89453125, 309.82501220703125, 612.8121643066406], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "AMAZON_2017_10K.pdf", "page_index": 57, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/AMAZON_2017_10K.pdf", "source": "marker"}